    <h1>How We Reduced Escaped Defects by 45% for a SaaS Client</h1>
    <p class="post-hero-lead">Escaped defects were costing a SaaS client customer trust and developer time. Here is exactly what we changed in the first three sprints to reduce them by 45%.</p>
